<title>CHILE: RESEARCH ALERT - Santander-Chile upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Santander-Chile upgraded.</headline>
<dateline>SANTIAGO 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings upgraded private bank Banco Santander-Chile to hold from sell.</p>
<p>Analysts Nuno Fernandes and Petru Vaduva said the upgrade was due to the bank's strong price decline since they initiated coverage in January.</p>
<p>Considering the poor results during first quarter 1997 and the fact that the bank still has 25 percent of Banco Osorno's loan portfolio to be re-examined this year, they said they remained cautious on the stock.  Osorno and Santander-Chile merged last year.</p>
<p>((--Roger Atwood, Santiago newsroom +56-2-699-5595 x211))</p>
